     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: sjw46<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=1709161<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>On the client end, if a binding key is incorrect, the error message is a<br/>\nNullPointerException with no additional detail.</p>\n\n<p>On the server end, a little more detail is logged, but the error message is<br/>\nstill unhelpful.</p>\n\n<p>The desired behavior is a human-readable error message to the client when an<br/>\ninvalid dissemination binding is given.</p>",
